# terseSuperColliderGraphSummary

- _terseSuperColliderGraphSummary(d, o)_

Run SuperCollider programs in reference files:

~~~spl
'Help/Reference'
.splFilePath
.terseSuperColliderGraphSummary(
	(
		verbose: true,
		pattern: '.*'
	)
)
~~~

* * *

See also: terseReferenceSummaryDo

Guides: Documentation Tests
